      "status": "success",
      "report": {
        "markdown": "The prediction ranks silver-tier loyalty members by their estimated likelihood of making at least one return in the 30 days after the data's latest date (2026-10-01). Kumo scored 415 silver customers and returned the top 25.\n\n| Customer | Likelihood of ≥1 return in next 30 days |\n| --- | --- |\n| C00802 | 37.4% |\n| C00610 | 29.1% |\n| C00975 | 23.2% |\n| C00030 | 23.1% |\n| C00963 | 22.7% |\n| C01008 | 22.5% |\n| C00527 | 22.0% |\n| C01365 | 21.2% |\n| C00798 | 20.1% |\n| C01162 | 19.9% |\n| C01289 | 19.7% |\n| C00871 | 19.2% |\n| C01198 | 18.6% |\n| C01255 | 17.6% |\n| C00615 | 15.6% |\n| C00027 | 15.4% |\n| C00033 | 15.3% |\n| C00464 | 13.8% |\n| C00842 | 13.4% |\n| C00008 | 13.3% |\n| C00987 | 13.2% |\n| C00959 | 13.1% |\n| C00467 | 12.6% |\n| C01070 | 12.4% |\n| C00342 | 12.2% |\n\n[1]\n\n**Limitations**: Probabilities are model estimates, not certainties. The ranking covers the 415 silver-tier customers in the data; 1,085 other customers (bronze, gold, or unscored) are not included. The 30-day horizon is calendar days from the anchor (2026-10-01).\n\n## Sources\n\n- [1] NVIDIA Kumo prediction result — retail.sales — evidence `hermes-receipt:9dee9614a5dea0acc2c9778505f45588edaddf98bbc9846baaef00d4a7ed764b`",
